  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SARDP III phase out 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SARDP III utfasn 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SARDP, Sida Amhara Rural Development Programme, integrerat landsbygdsutvecklingsprogram som startade 1997 och nu &#xe4;r inne i sin sista fas fram till juni 2010. Best&#xe5;r av fyra komponenter: naturresurser/lantm&#xe4;teri/jordbruk, ekonomisk diversifiering, infrastruktur, decentralisering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SARDP, Sida Amhara Rural Development Programme, which is an  integrated rural development programme in the Amhara region. The programme is in its final phase and is now being phased out finishing mid-2010. The programme started in 1997 and consists of four components: natural resources/land administration, economic  diversification, infrastructure, decentralisation.</narrative>
  </description>
